# T5.2: F5 runs the whole pad, one statement after another, and the pane
# says what the run did.

key 2
key c
wait busy

key Tab
type select 1 as one from dual
key Enter
key Enter
type select 2 as two from dual
key F5
wait busy

expect 2 statements, 2 result sets, 0 rows affected
frame multi-oracle
key Ctrl-Q
